      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "This sounds like an unimaginably desperate and hopeless situation you are describing. When facing such overwhelming odds, the weight of that final choice can feel crushing. If you are in crisis or feel you are in danger, please reach out to a crisis hotline immediately for support. You can connect with people who want to help by calling or texting 988 anytime in the US and Canada.",
