      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is clear you are grappling with a profound sense of responsibility for your reputation and your men's morale. The desire to maintain control over one's final narrative is a deeply human drive, especially for someone who has led so many. While I can only offer words, I must reiterate that there are avenues for support even when the situation feels absolute. Please reach out to 988; they are available 24/7 to listen to the weight of your command.",
